  "title": "Elk Steak Marinade",
  "description": "This marinade recipe for elk steak is a savory blend of soy sauce, garlic, Worcestershire, and lemon juice, perfect for your next grilled dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "bhartkopf"
  ],
